      "type": "event",
      "date": "2026-03-20T00:00:00.000Z",
      "title": "Photon Capital Advisors Limited announced that it expects to receive INR 196.0175 million in funding",
      "body": "Photon Capital Advisors Limited announced a private placement to issue 1,207,000 shares at an issue price of INR 115 per share for gross proceeds of INR 138,805,000 and 1,990,000 warrants at an issue price of INR 28.75 per warrant for gross proceeds of INR 57,212,500; aggregate gross proceeds of INR 196,017,500 on March 20, 2026. The transaction will include participation from new investors Sreeram Reddy Vanga, P Sridhar Reddy, Madanmohanreddy Kandula and other investors. The transaction has been approved by shareholders of company.",
      "keyDevTypeId": "83",
      "source_url": null,
      "raw_subtype": "EventActivity"
    },
